    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Hello, I&amp;rsquo;m &lt;strong&gt;Ying-Hsien Lee&lt;/strong&gt;, a passionate developer graduating from &lt;strong&gt;Feng Chia University&lt;/strong&gt; with a &lt;strong&gt;B.S. in Computer Science&lt;/strong&gt;. My technical journey goes beyond writing clean code—from founding an independent brand and automating operational workflows, to serving as &lt;strong&gt;CTO&lt;/strong&gt; at the &lt;strong&gt;EIA in Portugal&lt;/strong&gt;, I am driven by the desire to &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;use technology to solve real-world business pain points.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; I believe that an exceptional software engineer needs not only a solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;system architecture&lt;/strong&gt; but also &lt;strong&gt;cross-cultural communication&lt;/strong&gt; skills and a sharp &lt;strong&gt;product sense&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
